{"connection_id": "BC-ce1df354eae5cf5802e5", "ref": "WLC:Isa.32.20", "target": "sec9", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "sowing by waters with ox and donkey", "note": "The blessed sow beside all waters and let ox and donkey range out. It joins water, cultivation, and working animals, the same practical provision sequence that the commentary traces from rain to food and livestock."}
