{"connection_id": "BC-d918e31e847b28415c5e", "ref": "WLC:Gen.37.24", "target": "sec9", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "karsi_anlati", "basis": "empty cistern versus water drawing", "note": "The commentary’s next Yusuf scene has a bucket lowered to draw water and a boy discovered; Genesis explicitly says Joseph’s cistern was empty, making the means of discovery differ."}
